(Unpublished Master’s Thesis) Stockholm: Karolinska Institutet; 2013. [ Google Scholar ] 17. Breil B, Fritz F, Thiemann V, Dugas M. Mapping Turnaround Times (TAT) to a Generic Timeline: A Systematic Review of TAT Definitions in Clinical Domains. BMC Med Inform Decis Mak. 2011;11(1):34. doi: 10.1186/1472-6947-11-34. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 18. Ward MJ, Marsolo KA, Froehle CM. Applications of Business Analytics in Healthcare. Bus Horiz. 2014;57(5):571–582. doi: 10.1016/j.bushor.2014.06.003. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 19. Health Information and Quality Authority: Report of the investigation into the quality, safety and governance of the care provided by the Adelaide and Meath Hospital, Dublin incorporating the National Children’s Hospital (AMNCH) for patients who require acute admission - Recommendations [Internet]. HIQA, Dublin, 2012. [cited 2014 Jan 1]. Available from: http://www.hiqa.ie/publications/report-investigation-quality-safety-and-governance-care-provided-adelaide-and-meath-hos 20. Cook TS, Nagy P. Business Intelligence for the Radiologist: Making Your Data Work for You. J Am Coll Radiol. 2014;11(12, Part B):1238–1240. doi: 10.1016/j.jacr.2014.09.008. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 21. Golfarelli M, Rizzi S. What-if Simulation Modeling in Business Intelligence. Int J Data Warehouse Min. 2009;5(4):24–43. doi: 10.4018/jdwm.2009080702. [ DOI ] [ Google Scholar ] 22. Korbage AC, Bedi HS. Mobile Technology in Radiology Resident Education. J Am Coll Radiol. 2012;9(6):426–429. doi: 10.1016/j.jacr.2012.02.008. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 23. Morris H. The Financial Impact of Business Analytics: Build vs Buy. DM Rev. 2003;13:40–41. [ Google Scholar ]',20,'2025-10-15 10:12:54','2025-10-15 10:12:54');
