burczynski dorner hamadeh merrick discerning miame maqc consortiums miame maqc consortiums miame maqc exquisite microdissection nextgen ultralow z01 es102345 kerns mcelwee weida roxanne audenino alwine diazobenzyloxymethyl amacher herath sistare hamadeh grissom bartosiewicz buckpitt burczynski dorner burczynski mcmillian ciervo hicken farr hepatoma bushel hamadeh sieber nuwaysir paules afshari bushel hamadeh ableson misener afshari paules s1532 bushel heinloth boorman malarkey houle 2007a bushel wolfinger prototypes 2007b hubbell berno lockhart fodor biclustering bushel discernment paules bushel mckeeman kfi047 dudoit fridlyand resampling research0036 spellman botstein ellinger ziegelbauer fostel aruga boitier fevre fornace grenet interlaboratory kfp103 ellinger ziegelbauer wahle bomann nongenotoxic mrfmmm fielden mcmillian elangbam trela dragan fransson bogdanffy interlaboratory kfn022 fostel zwickl bushel kfi315 bhaskaran dambach mckeeman ganter tugendreich ayanoglu baumhueter bostian calvin chemogenomics jbiotec goeman geer kort houwelingen btg382 hamadeh bushel paules afshari biotechniques 2002a hamadeh bushel jayadev disorbo paules 2002b hamadeh jayadev maronpot furan mrfmmm hamadeh sieber bushel jayadev methapyrilene anchorage 2002c hamadeh afshari tx1000333 harries s0887 vollrath zastrow craven jovanovich walisser heinloth paules bushel hepatotoxicants jayadev disorbo farr marton stoughton armour johann mcguigan tomov conrads veenstra whiteley petricoin minowa uehara okuno nakatsu maruyama yamate lobenhofer merrick afshari notel luhe hildebrand dingermann ochratoxin kfg073 mattingly rosenstein colby zool jez merrick adductome toxicoproteomics bfgp eln004 jungmann isoproterenol dibutyryl knapton adeyemo noory hanig minami narahara katoh yokoi hepatotoxicant kfi235 pino elston jayyosi bonnefoi boorman naciff overmann torontali khambatta tiesman daston 17alpha ethinyl kfm046 nuwaysir trent afshari carcinog mc1 paules a338 a339 a338 peddada lobenhofer afshari umb