of neurotoxicity induced by 6׃6 PFPiA through disturbing the gut‒brain axis. Environ Sci Technol, 57(2): 1028-1038. 10.1021/acs.est.2c04765 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Zhao G, Sun HJ, Zhang T, et al. , 2020. Copper induce zebrafish retinal developmental defects via triggering stresses and apoptosis. Cell Commun Signal, 18: 45. 10.1186/s12964-020-00548-3 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Zhao XL, Huang XY, Peng WJ, et al. , 2022. Chlorine disinfection byproduct of diazepam affects nervous system function and possesses gender-related difference in zebrafish. Ecotoxicol Environ Saf, 238: 113568. 10.1016/j.ecoenv.2022.113568 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Zhao XY, Liu ZT, Zhang YN, et al. , 2024. Developmental effects and lipid disturbances of zebrafish embryos exposed to three newly recognized bisphenol A analogues. Environ Int, 189: 108795. 10.1016/j.envint.2024.108795 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Zhao YB, Liang JH, Meng HY, et al. , 2021. Rare earth elements lanthanum and praseodymium adversely affect neural and cardiovascular development in zebrafish ( Danio rerio ). Environ Sci Technol, 55(2): 1155-1166. 10.1021/acs.est.0c06632 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Zhou R, Ding RC, Yu Q, et al. , 2024. Metformin attenuates neutrophil recruitment through the H3K18 lactylation/reactive oxygen species pathway in zebrafish. Antioxidants, 13(2): 176. 10.3390/antiox13020176 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Zhou YX, Guo W, Lei L, et al. , 2021. Bis(2-ethylhexyl)-tetrabromophthalate induces zebrafish obesity by altering the brain-gut axis and intestinal microbial composition. Environ Pollut, 290: 118127. 10.1016/j.envpol.2021.118127 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Zhu BR, Lei L, Fu KY, et al. , 2022. Neurotoxicity of tetrabromobisphenol A and SiO 2 nanoparticle co-exposure in zebrafish and barrier function of the embryonic chorion. Sci Total Environ, 845: 157364. 10.1016/j.scitotenv.2022.157